{"question": "DEMO-1001 能退吗？", "session_id": "7f9a9b29-4608-411d-8504-759904c51998", "reply": "订单 DEMO-1001：已支付，未发货，无模拟退款记录，实付 19900 分。\n按办理规则：已支付、未发货且尚未退款，符合整单原路退款条件。 本轮仅解释资格。\n仅限已付款且尚未发货的本人订单按原支付渠道退回整笔实付款，已有成功模拟退款记录的订单除外。\n依据：《演示退款政策与常见问题》2.0 版 RF-083（文档编号 DEMO-REFUND-POLICY）。", "events": [{"event": "session_loaded", "pid": 167636, "session_id": "7f9a9b29-4608-411d-8504-759904c51998", "trace_id": null, "messages": 0, "checkpoint": false, "pending_nodes": []}, {"event": "graph_node", "pid": 167636, "session_id": "7f9a9b29-4608-411d-8504-759904c51998", "trace_id": "dceaa52c-03b3-41a8-ad7b-aa38f5ba7f69", "node": "intent"}, {"event": "intent", "pid": 167636, "session_id": "7f9a9b29-4608-411d-8504-759904c51998", "trace_id": "dceaa52c-03b3-41a8-ad7b-aa38f5ba7f69", "decision": {"intent": "order_question", "order_id": "DEMO-1001", "order_goal": "eligibility", "memory_request": null, "temporary_detail": null}}, {"event": "graph_node", "pid": 167636, "session_id": "7f9a9b29-4608-411d-8504-759904c51998", "trace_id": "dceaa52c-03b3-41a8-ad7b-aa38f5ba7f69", "node": "plan"}, {"event": "plan", "pid": 167636, "session_id": "7f9a9b29-4608-411d-8504-759904c51998", "trace_id": "dceaa52c-03b3-41a8-ad7b-aa38f5ba7f69", "plan": {"steps": [{"step_id": "order", "kind": "inspect_order", "order_id": "DEMO-1001", "depends_on": [], "completion": "取得本人订单事实"}, {"step_id": "policy", "kind": "retrieve_policy", "query": "DEMO-1001 能退吗？", "catalog_revision": null, "depends_on": ["order"], "completion": "按实际订单状态查找适用条款"}]}}, {"event": "graph_node", "pid": 167636, "session_id": "7f9a9b29-4608-411d-8504-759904c51998", "trace_id": "dceaa52c-03b3-41a8-ad7b-aa38f5ba7f69", "node": "execute"}, {"event": "execute", "pid": 167636, "session_id": "7f9a9b29-4608-411d-8504-759904c51998", "trace_id": "dceaa52c-03b3-41a8-ad7b-aa38f5ba7f69", "step_id": "order", "tool_budget": 1}, {"event": "deepagent_delegate", "pid": 167636, "session_id": "7f9a9b29-4608-411d-8504-759904c51998", "trace_id": "dceaa52c-03b3-41a8-ad7b-